[{"title":"尸位学署岑寂无聊泛泛随流迹近渔父每有闻见辄宣讴咏因名瀛涯渔唱 其五十三","author":"朱仕玠","text":"八足双螯出水浔，君谟误食笑难禁。\n不知许事自佳耳，且食沧溟斗大蟳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4687,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尸位学署岑寂无聊泛泛随流迹近渔父每有闻见辄宣讴咏因名瀛涯渔唱 其五十六","author":"朱仕玠","text":"强称此宅为吾有，那识消沉向此中。\n若见鹦螺应一笑，诸君尽属寄居虫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4688,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝命词","author":"朱术桂","text":"艰辛避海外，总为几根发。\n于今事毕矣，祖宗应容纳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4689,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚香玉绝句","author":"朱景英","text":"翠羽明珠欲比肩，香生细细月娟娟。\n销魂一种梨花梦，莫为横陈薄小怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4690,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吊殉节五妃墓","author":"何借宜","text":"寒烟碧草暗离披，隐隐高原见古碑。\n谩说从人皆妾妇，应誇死义是男儿。\n一缳未解王孙恨，千载犹闻鬼子悲。\n异域天荒开世运，五常还自五人持。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4691,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"红毛楼","author":"宋永清","text":"东西遥对海疆秋，高接云虚尺五楼。\n百户千窗迷野草，贺兰曾作万年谋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4692,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登小西天最高顶","author":"宋永清","text":"春来梅柳斗芳菲，散步清溪到翠微。\n怪石枯藤迷野径，残枝败叶拥禅扉。\n踏开觉路香生履，振落天花色染衣。\n更上一层回首处，故山遥望寸心违。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4693,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤崁城 其一","author":"李友棠","text":"城府开朝旭，川流世界东。\n楼台山色里，鼓角水声中。\n鸟坠炎洲气，猿吟暮岭风。\n升攀重阁迥，极望碧鸿濛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4694,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤崁城 其二","author":"李友棠","text":"高足未云骋，上头应有仙。\n岸昏涵蜃气，水滑带龙涎。\n日月光先到，云霞思独玄。\n沧波满归路，忆别动经年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4695,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾吟","author":"李钦文","text":"直从澎岛渡台湾，几阅春秋倏忽间。\n海国奇观冈号木，天涯胜迹凤名山。\n早潮鹿耳游人遍，晚渡安平舟子閒。\n知是圣朝恩泽远，遐荒久已辟贤关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4696,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙潭夜月","author":"李雰","text":"月皎寒潭清，夜深秋露白。\n骊龙自在眠，云影荡天碧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4697,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"屏山夕照","author":"李雰","text":"峭壁蒙葺绿，天然列画屏。\n夕阳残照里，添得十分青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4698,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金鸡晓霞","author":"周芬斗","text":"得瑞先鸣澎霭浮，朝朝彩绮拥沧洲。\n望同旭日临仙掌，疑是祥云护晓筹。\n卅六烟波烘赤澳，万千气象照红楼。\n蓬莱有客披星采，五色霞光载满舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4699,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁门烟雨","author":"周芬斗","text":"冥冥鸟道入云孤，万树苍茫望有无。\n罗汉岚昏乡信杳，南仙瘴暗锦书徂。\n记从槜李登楼赋，画就潇湘泛夜图。\n赵北佳名吴会景，好供槎客咏提壶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4700,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吞霄观海","author":"周钟瑄","text":"浩渺无因溯去程，仙槎客泛正须评。\n轻浮一粒须弥小，包括恒河色界清。\n世外形骸杯可渡，空中楼阁气嘘成。\n情知观海难为水，更有红轮向此生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4701,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题天妃宫","author":"季麒光","text":"补天五色漫称祥，谁向岐阳祝瓣香。\n几见平成踰大海，自知感应绕重洋。\n遐方俎豆尊灵远，圣代丝纶礼数庄。\n是处歌恩欣此日，风声潮影共趋跄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4702,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重游鲫鱼","author":"林奎章","text":"十一年前此地经，今朝认取古沙汀。\n水光不改当时绿，山色犹留旧日青。\n一幅画图鱼蟹舍，数家溪溆薜萝亭。\n乘桴熟睡波心稳，泊岸无须扣竹扃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4703,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌城【赤","author":"林麟昭","text":"歌舞楼台半已倾，女墙斜日照孤城。\n闲庭无复生芳草，复道犹闻唤晓莺。\n往事空悲时节换，圣朝长幸泰阶平。\n纵教沙碛千年在，烽静无烟夜月明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4704,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金鸡晓霞","author":"金鸣凤","text":"金鸡旭照气氤氲，片片晴霞布彩纹。\n万里沧波联锦绮，乾坤五色绘奇文。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4705,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中春雨后元棫岗学博共游鸿指园 其一","author":"柯辂","text":"别墅蓬瀛胜，招携试一临。\n径幽迷屐齿，花艳覆春阴。\n树石藤萝古，楼台烟雨深。\n到来真浩旷，吾亦爱山林。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4706,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中春雨后元棫岗学博共游鸿指园 其二","author":"柯辂","text":"三载宦游客，栖迟在海东。\n发从今日白，花似去年红。\n景物逍遥外，乾坤俯仰中。\n吾生几两屐，雪爪倦飞鸿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4707,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游竹溪寺","author":"洪坤","text":"挈伴寻春出郭游，寺门高耸接平畴。\n梵钟响彻松阴外，玉磬音传佛座头。\n嫩竹遥连村树绿，清溪倒映暮云浮。\n一钩隐现虚空际，羡尔山僧得静修。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4708,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"林氏家园","author":"洪禧","text":"入门何所有，萝薜乱穿墙。\n树密晴犹翳，庭阴暑亦凉。\n烟描疏柳黛，风度落花香。\n石磴沈吟处，书声出草堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4709,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"安平镇","author":"范昌治","text":"台湾何崱屴，安平祗孤岛。\n兀立大海中，洪波际天杪。\n鹿耳接鲲身，沙线明皛皛。\n重门分界险，桅樯不轻掉。\n拱护府基雄，湾环曲臂绕。\n守土一麾来，爱此屏藩好。\n夏日纵扁舟，望洋恣远眺。\n忆昔宦游人，无如东坡老。\n文从海外豪，光燄增奇巧。\n固陋每自惭，雕虫先压倒。\n下车况匝月，狂吟何草草。\n所志不在诗，因之寄怀抱。\n私冀胸次间，与海同大小。\n百川尽倾输，万象皆明瞭。\n秋涛动山岳，春波润枯槁。\n转愧愿难酬，问心可得表。\n保赤贵诚求，誇浮何足道。\n回看戍卒忙，艛橹镫齐燎。\n亟命挂帆归，迅疾等飞鸟。\n人坐画中船，月涌冰轮皎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4710,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元旦后四日庄副使斋头见菊花","author":"范咸","text":"迎年何事更争新，怪底真成海外春。\n花历三时如热客，蓂开五叶俨浮尘。\n幽姿岂必誇颜色，艳景难教信隐沦。\n输与寒梅仍应候，孤芳不肯早呈身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4711,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"木兰花歌","author":"范咸","text":"诗人赋物善言理，不似庭前格竹子。\n当知多识即是学，废目任耳非为美。\n我来蓬瀛大海东，探奇直欲穷苍穹。\n周诹询度百不厌，肯教过眼烟云空。\n采辑郡志二十卷，遗书掇拾行将遍。\n犹惭臆断恐失真，订误考疑敢云倦。\n贝多罗花诗已讹，琵琶形似终如何。\n就中无实难伪托，佛经欲写空槎那。\n因阅长庆忽顿悟，辛夷恍与木兰遇。\n内白外紫状如莲，点点青杨虫食蠹。\n昔人几度上芳舟，不识征帆逐远游。\n今日模糊才认得，新翻乐府却风流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4712,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤瓦歌有序","author":"范咸","text":"绛云火伞张海国，烧空灭尽青铜色。\n信知天运应炎方，抟土何缘变髹漆。\n万室于今陶者谁，炀灶浑疑欺白日。\n连掾栉比纷参差，画栋朱甍几回惑。\n汉家黄屋禁例严，风剥雨淋遮不得。\n临漳铜雀更何似，香姜旧款无人识。\n况兼四壁光炯炯，环堵恍与宫墙逼。\n帘前砖影更辉煌，彤墀彩绘盈阶墄。\n华棼俨上祝融峰，珠煤贯屋祥光直。\n千门万户火西驰，照耀烛龙乌戢翼。\n我思天台有赤城，朱霞天半称奇特。\n又闻南方裔外山，赤石为墙标异域。\n此间合是虹霓居，羲毂轩轩火鞭扶。\n六丁叱驭驱蛟螭，故发狂飙销鬼蜮。\n君不见火焰山头半焦土，爚爚如焚少荆棘。\n又不见焮翻地底硫磺山，草枯海破飞烟黑。\n麒麟之飓炊繁星，流金烁石鲸鲵息。\n温泉转作瘴母胎，裂窍烘池土花赩。\n刺桐万朵吐红丝，蓦地烧天怪繁殖。\n扶桑照殿逞鲜妍，艳艳絪缊锦交织。\n海若自来足光怪，丹邱浴日镕金霱。\n蒸郁恒旸阳用九，司天南正神明力。\n十八重溪水漰腾，九十九峰山崱屴。\n鲁阳挥戈势当逐，巫尪自焚尤应殛。\n炬牛燧象烂功勋，庶几赫怒彰天德。\n祇今海宴无烽尘，不烦煅鍊洪炉侧。\n承平但愿风雨调，永息炎威静八极。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4713,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌鱼有引","author":"范咸","text":"网鱼竞捕正头乌，兴味频嫌至后殊。\n海堀引回怜瘦剧，船头悬罟急徵输。\n钓缗信足骄渔父，幻化无须诳老夫。\n曾食江鲻争比得，芙蓉花里好提壶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4714,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鮡鱼次六给谏原韵","author":"范咸","text":"怒目棱棱遍体斑，蛇行也解曲回环。\n如何生在沧溟里，偏喜身居清浊间。\n虎穴掉头终不顾，龙门烧尾可知艰。\n烹鲜更怪成何味，丛笑令人鄙百蛮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4715,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题褚太守禄观稼图","author":"范咸","text":"北港地肥沃，种植恒不时。\n四月刈新谷，六月开新菑。\n十月收大冬，洵有不敛穧。\n罔知三年畜，转贩成漏卮。\n番儿学唐人，亦解把锄犁。\n时清风日好，鸡犬皆嬉嬉。\n槟榔簇凤尾，猱采同儿戏。\n弯弓射生手，徒充他人饥。\n褚侯河南后，跨海效一麾。\n动念仁民术，写出豳风诗。\n美哉二千石，愿更进微规。\n武侯治蜀严，宽猛常相持。\n既庶何以教，阿谁是良师。\n逋逃何以绝，穷黎何以肥。\n至治顺大化，贵与羲皇期。\n何时道德同，四海仰风仪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4716,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾纪巡诗 其三","author":"夏之芳","text":"野田晴晓碧天空，地指扶桑东复东。\n赤嵌城边云散彩，拓开海日一轮红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4717,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾纪巡诗 其四","author":"夏之芳","text":"负暄童叟爱冬温，红稻成堆拥荜门。\n桐竹周遭鸡犬静，教人历历认花村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4718,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其一","author":"孙霖","text":"竹枝环绕木为城，海不扬波颂太平。\n满眼珊瑚资护卫，人家篱落暮烟横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4719,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其二","author":"孙霖","text":"四季番花总是春，牙蕉香檨满盘新。\n投来更有菩提果，清供幽斋悟净因。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4720,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其三","author":"孙霖","text":"雌雄别味嚼槟榔，古贲灰和荖叶香。\n番女朱唇生酒晕，争看猱采耀蛮方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4721,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其四","author":"孙霖","text":"二八娇娃刺绣工，呼娘习惯便成风。\n新妆一队斜曛衬，小盖相携面半蒙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4722,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其五","author":"孙霖","text":"结缘才过又中元，施食层台市井喧。\n三令首除罗汉脚，只教普度闹黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4723,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其六","author":"孙霖","text":"禾间新搆认农家，遗意犹传毗舍耶。\n报赛秋成联士女，春来已验刺桐花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4724,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其七","author":"孙霖","text":"除却风风雨雨天，分装急唤渡头船。\n深秋播种清冬熟，拣得西瓜贡十员。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4725,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其八","author":"孙霖","text":"渐消狙犷渐恬熙，大杰巅头立社师。\n海宇同文臻雅化，爱听童子诵毛诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4726,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其九","author":"孙霖","text":"出草番儿每拍肩，踏歌欢饮不知年。\n伊尼无数惟功狗，贸易还徵贌社钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4727,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌竹枝词 其十","author":"孙霖","text":"庶鱼庶草剧难名，每讶寒宵壁虎鸣。\n一种绿毛么凤好，也誇文采满东瀛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4728,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送范浣浦巡视台湾 其一","author":"孙灏","text":"东瀛别岛入雕题，豸史威棱使节持。\n荒服尽联身臂指，重洋遥界国藩篱。\n六台宠命云边下，一范先声海外知。\n浩淼洪涛看此去，扶桑晴旭丽旌麾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4729,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送范浣浦巡视台湾 其二","author":"孙灏","text":"澎屿烟排点点青，鲲身鹿耳舵楼停。\n俗仍汉语兼番语，官是文星又福星。\n地络三山归保障，风乘万里驾沧溟。\n輶轩坐镇安清宴，但载皇仁播远听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4730,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送范浣浦巡视台湾 其三","author":"孙灏","text":"十一更长按海图，三千路近接明湖。\n未论丹荔黄柑美，先爱青帘画舫无。\n凤阙衔恩心北向，兰台惜别客南趋。\n绣衣旧使声华在，归望仙槎试问涂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4731,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"劝农归路经海会寺与诸同人分赋 其三","author":"书山","text":"劝农亲民事，归途逸兴同。\n地高浓翠合，林静妙香通。\n喜得千村雨，閒来一亩宫。\n寸心持半偈，顿觉海天空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4732,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过五妃墓","author":"祝道桩","text":"步出小南门，飞沙扑面飏。\n古冢生青草，残碑卧战场。\n昔日将军辟海疆，五妃同死殉明王。\n贞坟冷落寒梅瘦，雪后犹开五出芳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4733,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海口即事","author":"郝霔","text":"东宁黎庶日阗阗，树艺欣逢庆有年。\n贸易不分疆域异，稽查岂惜往来骈。\n稑穜满载权衡定，楼橹长驱姓氏镌。\n清晏波光思帝德，布帆无恙乐尧天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4734,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲子1744奉命赴台清查官庄即事成咏","author":"高山","text":"海峤长悬圣主心，沟涂经画戒相侵。\n含哺民近无怀氏，敷泽仁同解愠琴。\n履亩新塍勤劝相，支机旧石费追寻。\n重来不为开邛笮，要使飞鸮集好音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4735,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东宁十咏","author":"高拱乾","text":"春台广厦衔虚署，校艺监军职滥分。\n无力椎牛频飨士，有时倒屣细论文。\n平生拙处劳难补，异域愁来酒易醺。\n筋力未衰官兴浅，函关西隔万重云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4736,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东宁十咏","author":"高拱乾","text":"有怀须学蔺相如，每遇廉颇独让车。\n晚圃晴霞秋习射，半窗苦竹午临书。\n群公望隔三山杳，圣主明周万里馀。\n素志漫言伸未得，忘机直欲混樵渔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4737,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东宁十咏","author":"高拱乾","text":"尺檄如传空谷声，阻风经月少人行。\n关山已历三千里，樯橹犹迟十一更。\n地暖腊残无雪到，忧深鬓里任霜横。\n眼穿何处天边雁，京雒难忘故旧情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4738,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东宁十咏","author":"高拱乾","text":"竹弧射鹿万冈巅，?网张鱼百丈渊。\n幅布无裙供社饷，只鸡让食抵商钱。\n文身才起疮痍色，赤手谁将垢敝湔。\n为语绾符衔命吏，远人新附倍堪怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4739,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东宁十咏","author":"高拱乾","text":"索居寂寂近瓜期，报道清班拟暂移。\n高适岂堪常侍后，班超惟有玉关思。\n封侯夫婿何须侮，学步儿曹大更痴。\n自笑浮名终日累，海滨漫守使君碑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4740,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东宁十咏","author":"高拱乾","text":"谁言习俗乱丝同，揽辔澄清乏寸功。\n拊辑尚惭屏翰寄，更番何日戍楼空。\n拟携片石安归棹，聊订新编当采风。\n此去中原询异事，仙桃长对佛桑红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4741,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾八景","author":"高拱乾","text":"日脚红彝垒，烟中唤渡声。\n一钩新月浅，几幅淡帆轻。\n岸阔天迟暝，风微浪不生。\n渔樵争去路，总是画图情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4742,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾八景","author":"高拱乾","text":"海岸沙如雪，渔灯夜若星。\n依稀明月浦，隐跃白蘋汀。\n鲛室寒犹织，龙宫照欲醒。\n得鱼烹醉后，何处晓峰青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4743,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾八景","author":"高拱乾","text":"海门雄鹿耳，春色共潮来。\n二月青郊外，千盘白雪堆。\n线看沙欲断，射拟弩齐开。\n独喜西归舶，争随落处回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4744,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾八景","author":"高拱乾","text":"北去二千里，寒峰天外横。\n长年绀雪在，半夜碧鸡鸣。\n翠共峨眉积，炎消瘴海清。\n丹炉和石炼，漫拟玉梯行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4745,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾八景","author":"高拱乾","text":"海上看朝日，山间尚晓钟。\n天开无际色，人在最高峰。\n紫阁催妆镜，咸池骇浴龙。\n风流灵运句，灼灼照芙蓉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4746,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾八景","author":"高拱乾","text":"孤屿澎湖近，晴霞返照时。\n秋高移绛树，海晏捲朱旗。\n孙楚城头赋，刘郎江上诗。\n淋漓五色笔，直欲补天亏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4747,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾八景","author":"高拱乾","text":"有怀同海阔，无事得台高。\n瓜忆安期枣，山驱太白鳌。\n鸿濛归紫贝，腥秽涤红毛。\n济涉平生意，何辞舟楫劳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4748,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台湾八景","author":"高拱乾","text":"岛居多异籁，大半是涛鸣。\n试向竹亭听，全非松阁声。\n人传沧海啸，客讶不周倾。\n消夏清谈倦，如驱百万兵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4749,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海会寺","author":"娄广","text":"此地当年拟馆娃，蜃楼海市霸图赊。\n王孙已去遗芳草，宫院谁来扫落花。\n歌管声沈闻贝叶，舞衫采彻现袈裟。\n我非佞佛閒随喜，喜见梯航属一家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":4750,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]